s Dilemma. My understanding is solidifying around the probabilities linked to identical agents' choices. I'm focusing on why EDT prescribes cooperation (keeping quiet) given the strong correlation between the agents' decisions. I see that the utility function and payoff structure of the game influence my decision of the ideal action to take. I'm working on the formalization.\n\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":1}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":7834,"completion_tokens":413,"total_tokens":8247,"cost":0.00742425,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.00742425,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.0058755,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00154875},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":412,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}